        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Milky Way is like practice, the moon is bright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four gods meet you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across thousands of years, they've made countless choices to meet you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now the choice is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the first time we've met, but I seem to have seen you before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;With Quilt&quot; is a AVG game for female, you will play a home textile designer, and in charge of different materials of quilt gods to start the story. The character of the protagonist is selectable, I/E branch line, whether it is waiting for a good edge or bold pursuit of love, weave your love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >银河如练，月光皎皎。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >四位神祇与你在此邂逅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >跨越千年时光，为了遇见你，他们曾做出无数抉择。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >而如今，选择的权利交到了你的手上。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >初次见面，但念卿已久。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《与衾》是一款乙女向AVG游戏，你将扮演一位家纺设计师，和掌管不同材质的被子神灵展开故事。主人公性格可选，I/E分线，无论是静候佳缘还是大胆追爱，编织属于你的爱恋吧。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Milky Way is like practice, the moon is bright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four gods meet you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across thousands of years, they've made countless choices to meet you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now the choice is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the first time we've met, but I seem to have seen you before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;With Quilt&quot; is a AVG game for female, you will play a home textile designer, and in charge of different materials of quilt gods to start the story. The character of the protagonist is selectable, I/E branch line, whether it is waiting for a good edge or bold pursuit of love, weave your love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >银河如练，月光皎皎。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >四位神祇与你在此邂逅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >跨越千年时光，为了遇见你，他们曾做出无数抉择。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >而如今，选择的权利交到了你的手上。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >初次见面，但念卿已久。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《与衾》是一款乙女向AVG游戏，你将扮演一位家纺设计师，和掌管不同材质的被子神灵展开故事。主人公性格可选，I/E分线，无论是静候佳缘还是大胆追爱，编织属于你的爱恋吧。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
